    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have acquired the training necessary to effectively arm yourself for battle. You gain proficiency with Medium Armor, Shields, and Martial Weapons.</p><p>Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can touch one weapon that you are proficient with and that lacks the Two-Handed property. When you attack with that weapon, you can use your <strong>Charisma modifier</strong>, instead of Strength or Dexterity, for the attack and damage rolls. This benefit also extends to every weapon you conjure or wield with the <em>Pact of the Blade</em> feature.</p>",
